---
// src/components/features/landing/comp-services.astro
---
<section id="services" class="snap-section services-section">
  <a href="#top" class="back-to-top" aria-label="Volver al inicio" title="Volver al inicio">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path>
    </svg>
  </a>

  <div class="container services-container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="section-badge">Qué Hacemos</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Servicios que Impulsan tus Ventas</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Diseño y desarrollo de alta gama para posicionar tu marca y capturar más clientes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <!-- Servicio 1 -->
      <div class="service-card glass-panel">
        <div class="service-icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="32" height="32" class="service-icon">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 11c0 3.517-1.009 6.799-2.753 9.571m-3.44-2.04l.054-.09A13.916 13.916 0 009 11V7a5 5 0 00-10 0v4c0 1.38.397 2.667 1.057 3.75l.02.036m3.3-3.771a2.182 2.182 0 00-3.3 1.8v2.18c0 1.16.186 2.264.525 3.291m1.3-3.291a2.182 2.182 0 013.3-1.8v2.18c0 1.16-.186 2.264-.525 3.291m-4.725-13.69C5.402 1.316 9.4 0 14 0c4.6 0 8.598 1.316 10.742 3.75M12 11c0-3.517 1.009-6.799 2.753-9.571m3.44 2.04l-.054.09A13.916 13.916 0 0015 11v4c0 1.38-.397 2.667-1.057 3.75l-.02.036m-3.3-3.771a2.182 2.182 0 013.3 1.8v2.18c0 1.16-.186 2.264-.525 3.291m-1.3-3.291a2.182 2.182 0 00-3.3-1.8v2.18c0 1.16.186 2.264.525 3.291" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card-title">Identidad de Marca & Logo</h3>
        <p class="service-card-desc">Rediseñamos la cara de tu negocio. Logos vectoriales profesionales y manuales de marca para inspirar confianza y autoridad ante tus clientes desde el primer segundo.</p>
        
        <div class="service-card-footer">
          <span class="service-card-badge">
            <span class="badge-icon">🪙</span> ACCESO ECONÓMICO
          </span>
          <span class="service-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Servicio 2 -->
      <div class="service-card glass-panel featured-service">
        <span class="popular-ribbon">★ MÁS POPULAR</span>
        <div class="service-icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="32" height="32" class="service-icon">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card-title">Webs y Landings que Venden</h3>
        <p class="service-card-desc">Sitios estáticos a medida ultra-rápidos (compilados con Astro) que cargan al instante en celulares. Optimizados con copywriting persuasivo para convertir visitas en llamadas y mensajes.</p>
        
        <div class="service-card-footer">
          <span class="service-card-badge featured-badge">
            <span class="badge-icon">👑</span> EL SERVICIO PRINCIPAL
          </span>
          <span class="service-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Servicio 3 -->
      <div class="service-card glass-panel">
        <div class="service-icon-box">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="32" height="32" class="service-icon">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card-title">Sistemas e Integración con IA</h3>
        <p class="service-card-desc">Automatizamos los procesos de tu negocio. Capturamos llamadas de técnicos en ruta, integramos agendas con tu CRM y automatizamos respuestas por WhatsApp apoyados en IA.</p>
        
        <div class="service-card-footer">
          <span class="service-card-badge">
            <span class="badge-icon">🚀</span> ALTA GAMA
          </span>
          <span class="service-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de Propuesta Inferior -->
    <div class="services-action-bar glass-panel">
      <div class="action-phone-box">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="20" height="20">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.94.725l.548 2.2a1 1 0 01-.321.988l-1.305.98a10.582 10.582 0 004.872 4.872l.98-1.305a1 1 0 01.988-.321l2.2.548a1 1 0 01.725.94V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="action-texts">
        <h4 class="action-title">¿Quieres una propuesta a la medida de tu negocio?</h4>
        <p class="action-desc">Solicita tu diagnóstico premium 100% gratuito.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-action-audit">
        <span>Solicitar diagnóstico gratuito &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-section {
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-slow);
    position: relative;
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  .back-to-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-to-top:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-card-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .services-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .section-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .service-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .featured-service {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.08);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .featured-service {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.06);
  }

  .popular-ribbon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary-text);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .service-icon-box {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .service-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .service-icon {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .service-card-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .service-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Pie de tarjeta */
  .service-card-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }

  .service-card-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .badge-icon {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .featured-badge {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    border-color: rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.3);
    background-color: rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.03);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .featured-badge {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    border-color: rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.2);
    background-color: rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.03);
  }

  .service-arrow {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .service-card:hover .service-arrow {
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }

  /* Barra de Acción de propuesta */
  .services-action-bar {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 2.25rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  html[data-theme="brand"] .services-action-bar {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary); /* Borde azul oscuro de la paleta en modo claro */
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.08);
  }

  .action-phone-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary-text);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .action-texts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    flex-grow: 1;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .action-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .action-desc {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .btn-action-audit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 8px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .services-action-bar {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .action-texts {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn-action-audit {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .back-to-top {
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
